#: data/scripts/gift_trainer.inc:22
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftVisitingTrainerInstructions"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"By holding this WONDER CARD, you\n"
"may take part in a survey at a\l"
"POKéMON MART.\p"
"Use these surveys to invite\n"
"TRAINERS to SOOTOPOLIS CITY.\p"
"…Let me give you a secret\n"
"password for a survey:\p"
"“GIVE ME\n"
"AWESOME TRAINER”\p"
"Write that in on a survey and send\n"
"it to the WIRELESS\l"
"COMMUNICATION SYSTEM.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"持有这张神奇卡片，\n"
"就可以参加友好商店的\l"
"问卷调查。\p"
"通过问卷调查，\n"
"可以邀请训练家来琉璃市。\p"
"……我来告诉你\n"
"问卷调查用的秘密暗号：\p"
"“GIVE ME\n"
"AWESOME TRAINER”\p"
"把它写在问卷上，然后发送给\n"
"无线通信系统吧。$"

#: data/scripts/gift_trainer.inc:38
msgctxt "sText_MysteryGiftVisitingTrainerArrived"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"GIFT System.\p"
"A TRAINER has arrived in\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS CITY looking for you.\p"
"We hope you will enjoy\n"
"battling the visiting TRAINER.\p"
"You may invite other TRAINERS by\n"
"entering other passwords.\p"
"Try looking for other passwords\n"
"that may work.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘礼物系统。\p"
"有一位训练家来到了琉璃市，\n"
"正在找你。\p"
"希望你能享受\n"
"和来访训练家的对战。\p"
"输入其他暗号，\n"
"还可以邀请其他训练家。\p"
"试着找找其他\n"
"可能有效的暗号吧。$"
